"""
PGS India - Peers Appraisal Helper   (single-file source)
=========================================================
Adds the farmers to a Peers Appraisal on pgsindia-ncof.gov.in.  You log in and fill in the top part of the
"Add Peers Appraisal" page yourself; the tool then goes through the Farmer dropdown, chooses the crop category
and crop for each farmer, reads "Offered for organic" and types the matching area / expected yield / self
consumption, and presses ADD.  It never presses Save & Next - you check the list and do that yourself.

One window, three screens:  Launcher -> Installer -> Main tool.

  Run from source :  python PGS_Peers_Appraisal.py
  Build the exe   :  see build.yml (GitHub)  ->  PGS_Peers_Appraisal.exe
"""

